			"notes": "Multi-provider update with runtime cache invalidation and improved configuration layout.\n\n### Changes\n* Added Ely.by skin provider integration alongside TLauncher\n* Implemented synchronized SkinProviderRouter for multi-backend fetching\n* Implemented custom Cloth Config ButtonEntry for runtime cache invalidation\n* Added instant \"Refresh Skins\" button to clear memory and disk caches on the fly\n* Fully automated dynamic configuration saving to prevent metadata loss\n* Fixed Fabric log spam by forcing strict 256x256 square mod icon proportions\n* Added official ModMenu metadata links (Homepage, Sources, Issue Tracker)\n\n### Requirements\n* Minecraft 26.1.2\n* Fabric Loader\n* Fabric API\n* Cloth Config\n* Java 25"
